ex>0 coverage; ratio 2/2 derived classes covered. Reviewer fourth-source mutant (raw ReadDir, source system) reddens; collectDirectory-shaped fourth source also reddens.`\\\\n`- F10 digest sweep: new TestVerifyRefusesDigestChangeAtEveryByteIndex, 32/32 byte positions refused with 31-shared-bytes assertion each. Mutant sum[1:] reddens at byte 0 while the late-byte test passes — the mirrored shape demonstrated and closed.`\\\\n`- F8: rev1 entry 0210 and rev2 entry 0230 landed verbatim in LOGBOOK.md above 0115, newest first.`\\\\n`## Evidence`\\\\n`- go test ./internal/provider/ -count=1 exit 0, 43 top-level PASS, cover 94.1pct; go test ./... -count=1 exit 0, all 14 packages; go vet ./... exit 0; GOOS=windows build ok; tracecheck exit 0 unchanged at 17/403 bindings=49.`\\\\n`- provider.go verified byte-identical after every mutation batch (diff against pre-batch backup); worktree clean; commit signature verified with git verify-commit.`\\\\n`## Disclosures (not rework)`\\\\n`- Windows owner attestation still unverified at runtime (cross-compile only); §7.1 ownership claim still deferred to orchestrator (tracecheck 17/403 unchanged).\\\", type=outcome, description=\\\"Round-3 rework notes for F6-F10 with mutation evidence\\\")' 2>&1 | tail -3\",\n  \"description\": \"Attach rework notes artifact\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2890sd\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-2890sd_rework2-notes.md\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"outcome\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-2890sd/TASK-260830-2890sd_rework2-notes.md\\\"}}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 181,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 46,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
